# ── Confidential / investor material — MUST NOT enter a repo that will be public
#
# ⛔ AUDIT_PUBLICATION_PLAN.md schedules this repository to be made PUBLIC on TGE
#    day. It tracked a "Confidential Token Incentive Side Letter" and a "Token
#    Allocation Confirmation (Private Schedule)" — investor contract terms — plus
#    a tokenomics wallet document. Publishing would have disclosed them.
#
# ⚠️ Removing the files does NOT remove them from git history. A history purge on
#    BOTH remotes must precede publication, and must be verified against the HOST
#    rather than by cloning: a clone only proves reachability, and a dangling
#    object stays fetchable by SHA until the host garbage-collects.
Tokenomics & Investor Material/
*Confidential*.pdf
*Private Schedule*.pdf
